  "name": "AI lead finder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 11. AI lead finder + outreach\nForm (business type, city, your offer) → free OpenStreetMap search (backup server if the main one is busy) → keep businesses with a website → read each website → Claude Haiku 5.5 writes a personal first line using only facts from that site → Google Sheet (updates rows, no duplicates) → Telegram summary.\n\nDead or blocked websites are saved as \"Check manually\".\nTip: use the city's English map name (e.g. Addis Ababa, Manchester, Greater London).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 700
      },
